==Strategy==
This stage may seem daunting, but it can be beaten with only moderate difficulty. Any powerful [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Anti-Floating Cats]] will be able to handle the waves of enemies, especially when accompanied by a Rusher such as [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]].

If you have [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], the stage is almost trivial, as he can easily kill both Manbosaki as long as he isn't getting repeatedly hit. He isn't a free win card, but he is your best bet.

